== Effects ==
* Whenever Isaac places a {{e|Bomb}}, an extra bomb is spawned next to the original.
** This does not consume more than one bomb pickup.

== Notes ==
* The extra bomb spawns in a random location adjacent to the original.
* The additional bomb is affected by any items that affect bombs.
* Ring Cap will also work with {{E|Giga Bomb}}s collected via {{T|Safety Scissors}}.
* Can be used to open the door to [[Bedroom]]s and the {{s|Mines}} / {{s|Ashpit}} with only one bomb.
* This trinket has no effect on the [[Pills|Explosive Diarrhea]] pill.
* The bombs explode simultaneously with each other, without risk of any being launched.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{I|Mom's Box}}: Places 1 extra bomb per copy.
* {{t|Blasting Cap}}: The extra bomb also has a chance to drop a bomb pickup.
* {{I|Nancy Bombs}}: Grants a random bomb effect to each bomb separately.
* {{i|Rocket in a Jar}}: Fires two rockets simultaneously.

